{
  "_about": "One row per handheld. Matched on DMI ids (/sys/class/dmi/id). 'support': full = tested on the device by us, beta = confirmed by testers, generic = matched but untested. Power ranges in watts. Sources: ClawDeck's tested hardware table, PowerStation's device database. 'profiles': watts (TDP = PL1) for the battery / balanced / performance profiles, from ClawDeck's tested profile table; rows without it get a spread of their range. 'pl2_offset_w': boost limit PL2 = TDP + this (Intel). 'tdp_backends': which power services to try, in order (default steamos-manager, then powerstation).",
